      "fix": "Render an inline alert with a \"Retry\" button that re‑calls fetchTxns. Replace the \"Loading...\" text with three skeleton <Card> components using var(--c-surface) and var(--shadow-card). Detect offline status (navigator.onLine) and display a top banner \"You’re offline – showing cached data\"."
    },
